    {
      "type": "text", "id": "rc_note", "x": 700, "y": 1120, "width": 1150, "height": 50,
      "text": "workers/queue.py  ·  workers/bus.py  ·  services/recognition.py\nPaddle is imported only inside services/recognition.py, so the API, the tests\nand CI all run on a machine with no GPU and no Paddle installed.",
      "originalText": "workers/queue.py  ·  workers/bus.py  ·  services/recognition.py\nPaddle is imported only inside services/recognition.py, so the API, the tests\nand CI all run on a machine with no GPU and no Paddle installed.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
