    {
      "type": "text", "id": "ps_rule_label", "x": 2062, "y": 1560, "width": 700, "height": 22,
      "text": "What holds the design together",
      "originalText": "What holds the design together",
      "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 500057, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 500058, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "ps_rule1", "x": 2062, "y": 1598, "width": 880, "height": 50,
      "text": "1  Dependencies run one way: api > services > repository > domain. domain imports\n   nothing but the standard library, and Paddle is imported only inside\n   services/recognition.py, so the API, the tests and CI run with no GPU present.",
      "originalText": "1  Dependencies run one way: api > services > repository > domain. domain imports\n   nothing but the standard library, and Paddle is imported only inside\n   services/recognition.py, so the API, the tests and CI run with no GPU present.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 500059, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 500060, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "ps_rule2", "x": 2062, "y": 1668, "width": 880, "height": 50,
      "text": "2  Uploads are untrusted and content addressed. The 50 MiB cap is enforced before\n   multipart spooling, storage names never come from the uploaded filename, and the\n   digest decides whether a GPU run is needed at all.",
      "originalText": "2  Uploads are untrusted and content addressed. The 50 MiB cap is enforced before\n   multipart spooling, storage names never come from the uploaded filename, and the\n   digest decides whether a GPU run is needed at all.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 500061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 500062, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text", "id": "ps_rule3", "x": 2062, "y": 1738, "width": 880, "height": 50,
      "text": "3  Accuracy is measured, not asserted. services/evaluation.py scores CER against\n   hand-transcribed samples with one-to-one IoU line matching. Character count is not\n   accuracy: an engine can emit more characters and still score worse.",
      "originalText": "3  Accuracy is measured, not asserted. services/evaluation.py scores CER against\n   hand-transcribed samples with one-to-one IoU line matching. Character count is not\n   accuracy: an engine can emit more characters and still score worse.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 500063, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 500064, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25
    },

